"type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"忧","pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"憂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huàn","traditional":"患","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Adapun yang dinamai 'untuk membina diri harus lebih dahulu meluruskan hati' itu ialah: diri yang diliputi geram dan marah, tidak dapat berbuat lurus; yang diliputi takut dan khawatir tidak dapat berbuat lurus, yang diliputi suka dan gemar, tidak dapat berbuat lurus, dan yang diliputi sedih dan sesal, tidak dapat berbuat lurus."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.08.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"心","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"视","pinyin":"shì","traditional":"視","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"听","pinyin":"tīng","traditional":"聽","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"闻","pinyin":"wén","traditional":"聞","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shí","traditional":"食","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"味","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Hati yang tidak pada tempatnya, sekalipun melihat takkan tampak, meski mendengar takkan terdengar dan meski makan takkan merasakan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.08.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiū","traditional":"修","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"心","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Inilah sebabnya dikatakan, bahwa untuk membina diri itu berpangkal pada melurus hati."}],"source_file":"01 - Da Xue 大學/08 - Bab VII - Meluruskan Hati Membina Diri.md","title":"Bab VII — Meluruskan Hati Membina Diri"}
